UID:IXoVdQtc44hy8pT4BYlqS
SUMMARY:Grupo Duelo in Concert at Toyota Center
DTSTAMP:20260819T033136Z
DTSTART:20260822T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Toyota Center welcomes Grupo Duelo\, and their Gravedad Tour 20
	26\, for 3 consecutive nights on the arena stage in Downtown Houston. \nFo
	r 26 years\, Grupo Duelo has established itself as one of the leading forc
	es in romantic norteño across Mexico and the United States. \nThis new cha
	pter marks an evolution in the band’s journey\, introducing a reimagined s
	how that elevates their artistic vision through a striking stage productio
	n and a deeply moving musical experience. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $4
	5. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was spon
	sored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and m
	ore details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, busi
	ness\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston
	.com/calendar/grupo-duelo-in-concert-at-toyota-center-2/\n\nFrom 365 Thing
	s to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/grupo-duelo-in-concert-at-toyot
	a-center-2/
LOCATION:Toyota Center\, 1510 Polk St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United State
	s
